Meet our Team New Student Orientation Student Support Resources University Police Rams Rewards Back About FSU Explore\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAbout FSU Back Search Explore\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSearch Back Info For... Explore\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo For... Home Campus Life The Center For Student Experience & Career Development The Center for Student Experience & Career Development Get Involved Welcome to The Center for Student Experience and Career Development at Framingham State University! We're here to support you throughout your journey at FSU and beyond. Our mission is to help you find your passions, develop important skills, and achieve your professional goals. From the very beginning, starting with New Student Orientation, we ensure every new Ram feels at home. We foster student involvement through diverse organizations, events, activities, and opportunities for you to connect with fellow students. By getting involved, you can discover new interests and gain skills that will set you up for life after college. With our support, you can step into leadership roles within student organizations or just enjoy connecting with peers by participating in the many campus events. Throughout your time at Framingham State, we're here to help you craft a career plan tailored to your goals. Our comprehensive services include career counseling, internship placements, resume workshops, and networking opportunities with alumni and industry leaders. Our team will support you every step of the way, ensuring you have the tools and resources needed to thrive in today's competitive job market. We're dedicated to giving you the ultimate support and guidance to navigate college with confidence and seize every opportunity. Here, you'll not only achieve your goals but also create unforgettable memories and lifelong connections. Join us, and let's make your time at FSU truly extraordinary! In this section Student Experience & Career Development Career Development Employers Incoming Student Resources FSU Internship Guidelines Post-Grad Planning & Alumni Resources Anti-Racist Efforts and Identity Based Resources Clubs & Organizations FAQs Meet our Team New Student Orientation Reasons to Get Involved Build Community : Forge connections with fellow students and become an integral part of the vibrant FSU community. Enhance Skills : Develop essential skills and strengths through diverse experiences and leadership opportunities. Boost Your Resume : Gain valuable experiences that will make your resume stand out to future employers. Make Friends : Meet like-minded individuals, form lasting friendships, and create a strong support network. Stay on Track : Engaging in campus activities helps you stay focused, motivated, and on the path to graduation. Discover Yourself : Explore your interests, uncover new passions, and grow as an individual within society. Play video Close Paige's Student Experience Listen to Paige share how special FSU's student experience is, and how connected she feels. Meet Paige Resources Career Development RamLink Footer--Navigate Find a Program News & Events Take A Class Request Info Contact Library Directory Careers Facebook Instagram LinkedIn Youtube 100 State Street PO Box 9101 Framingham , MA 01701 United States © 2026 Framingham State University. All Rights Reserved. Footer Bottom Links NET Price Calculator Privacy Statement Accessibility"
